 "CleaningAdvisor ⊣ Industrial Cleaning Governor, langgraph-clj
 StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. A cleaning-and-certification
 BACK-OFFICE COORDINATION actor for an independent industrial
 equipment-cleaning contractor -- not direct wash/spray/dispense-
 equipment control authority and not a real certification-signing
 authority. Four ops (`:log-cleaning-completion` /
 `:certification-scan` / `:flag-safety-concern` /
 `:schedule-recleaning`), all `:effect :propose` only. Thirteen
 concrete governor checks: propose-only effect, closed op allowlist,
 closed proposal-effect allowlist (no direct cleaning-equipment
