 threshold (never trusting a proposal's own self-reported decision),
 residue-reading plausibility validation, independent on-file-failed-
 certification gate before any re-clean may be scheduled (or billed),
 double-schedule guard, and cleaning-job-duration plausibility
 validation. Safety-concern flagging (confined-space entry --
 OSHA 29 CFR 1910.146; hazardous chemical residue -- OSHA 29 CFR
 1910.1200) ALWAYS escalates to a human contractor-operator;
 `:log-cleaning-completion` is the only op eligible to auto-commit,
 and only at phase 3 when governor-clean."}
